  "description": "20+ protections with 30s overload auto-recovery, plus pre-charge and enhanced moisture & salt-spray resistance.\n\nThe advanced built-in BMS safeguards the battery against overcharging, over-discharging, and short circuits while ensuring optimal cell balance.\n\nAniioki battery uses Grade A EV cells for exceptional quality, higher energy density, and greater power, certified by testing for highest level of safety.\n\nThe fully integrated battery compartment features a reinforced 4mm-thick protective casing, delivering enhanced structural strength and comprehensive protection.\n\nPrecision crafted performance. The adjustable front fork and rear spring suspension efficiently absorb impacts from rocks, tree roots, and ruts, enhancing control and delivering a smoother ride.\n\nPrecision crafted performance. The adjustable front fork and rear spring suspension efficiently absorb impacts from rocks, tree roots, and ruts, enhancing control and delivering a smoother ride.\n\nThe 5.2-inch color display shows three assist levels (1, 2, and 3), current speed, battery level, odometer, and other information, ensuring you can easily monitor your ride status day or night.\n\n2.34\" Color LCD with USB-A Charging: The clear display shows speed, battery level, gear, trip mileage, and more. A built-in USB-A port keeps your phone charged during long rides.",
